Silven Grayson is a sharp-dressed human male in his mid-twenties, inheriting the family's striking stark-white hair and cool slate-gray eyes, immaculate in amber-and-black formal wear with a subtle stylized pulse motif stitched into the lining.

Silven is a member of [[Org/Amber Call/index|Amber Call]]. He came aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] for the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]] with [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/People/Manus Sudrenus|Manus Sudrenus]] and [[Org/NecroLog/People/Gaspar Caetano|Gaspar Caetano]], and when the tear opened in the banquet floor he bent one of the Ki-Rin to his will and drew his people off the floor. Afterwards he and Manus were seen treating the barghest corpses with alchemical reagents. He is personable and keeps a friendly face, and politely declined [[People/Argyle|Argyle]]'s offer of healing.
